WEBVTT

00:02.910 --> 00:05.980
<i>Hyuga takes a shot from right outside the penalty area!</i>

00:07.080 --> 00:10.150
Even Tsubasa can't score from outside of the penalty area.

00:10.150 --> 00:13.240
Of course it'd be impossible for you!

00:13.240 --> 00:14.700
<i>"Even Tsubasa," huh...?</i>

00:19.100 --> 00:20.200
Damn it!

00:20.200 --> 00:20.910
<i>Captain...</i>

00:20.910 --> 00:24.040
<i>Why are you so obsessed with shooting from so far out?</i>

00:24.520 --> 00:25.700
Hyuga...

00:25.700 --> 00:30.090
I'll be frank. The way you've played today
is not Meiwa's usual style.

00:30.090 --> 00:31.420
<i>What did you say?</i>

00:31.420 --> 00:35.060
Meiwa's is supposed to be
a style of football that wins at all costs.

00:35.060 --> 00:39.800
But today, Hyuga, all you've done is shoot over and over again from outside the penalty area!

00:39.800 --> 00:42.100
That is nothing like Meiwa's football!

00:44.710 --> 00:45.980
Hyuga!

00:46.540 --> 00:47.770
Takeshi...

00:48.940 --> 00:50.880
You're absolutely right.

00:52.310 --> 00:57.150
Honestly, my admission to Toho Academy is at stake, here.

00:57.150 --> 01:01.280
But the scout also mentioned they were looking at Tsubasa Ozora.

01:02.130 --> 01:05.530
That's why I kept shooting from outside of the penalty area,

01:05.530 --> 01:08.870
to prove once and for all that I am superior to Tsubasa.

01:08.870 --> 01:12.060
But, that's a mistake.

01:12.060 --> 01:14.860
It took Takeshi telling me to realize that.

01:14.860 --> 01:16.130
Hyuga...

01:16.920 --> 01:21.070
I will steal a goal from Wakabayashi in this second half, no matter how!

01:21.070 --> 01:23.850
That's Meiwa's style, our winning football!

01:23.850 --> 01:26.270
We will turn this around,
and win for sure!

01:26.270 --> 01:27.560
Hyuga!

01:27.560 --> 01:28.500
You are right!

01:28.500 --> 01:30.020
Let's do it, Hyuga!

01:31.430 --> 01:35.230
<i>Half-time is over, and the players
from both teams are again out on the field.</i>

01:35.230 --> 01:37.800
<i>Only these last 20 minutes remain.</i>

01:37.800 --> 01:39.610
Hurry up, mom!

01:38.740 --> 01:40.530
<i>Nankatsu has a one-goal lead.</i>

01:39.610 --> 01:40.530
All right, all right.

01:40.530 --> 01:44.410
<i>Will they be able to keep it up
and raise the purple championship pennant?</i>

01:44.410 --> 01:49.210
<i>Or will Meiwa turn the tables this second half,
and become the champions instead?</i>

01:49.210 --> 01:52.040
<i>It's almost time for the kick-off.</i>

02:04.080 --> 02:09.690
<i>The smell of the grass when I stumbled,</i>

02:04.080 --> 02:09.690
<i>koronda toki no shibafu no nioi</i>

02:09.690 --> 02:14.740
<i>the endless blue of the sky above...</i>

02:09.690 --> 02:14.740
<i>aogimita sora no ao hateshinakatta</i>

02:15.410 --> 02:20.540
<i>This winding, back-and-forth path</i>

02:15.410 --> 02:20.540
<i>mayotte modori susumu kidô ga</i>

02:21.290 --> 02:28.880
<i>is a map for our endless dreams</i>

02:21.290 --> 02:28.880
<i>hateshinai yume o miru boku-tachi no chizu</i>

02:28.880 --> 02:34.650
<i>Even if my hopes miss the goal</i>

02:28.880 --> 02:34.650
<i>goal o soreta kibô ga atte mo</i>

02:34.650 --> 02:43.150
<i>if I stand back up, my dreams will never end</i>

02:34.650 --> 02:43.150
<i>mata tachiagaru nara yume wa owaranai</i>

02:43.150 --> 02:48.940
<i>No.1! Race forth, faster than anyone</i>

02:43.150 --> 02:48.940
<i>No. 1! dare yori hayaku kakenuke</i>

02:48.940 --> 02:54.870
<i>Make a starting dash toward the world stage with your tricky plays!</i>

02:48.940 --> 02:54.870
<i>tricky na play de sekai e muke Start! Dash!</i>

02:54.870 --> 02:56.410
<i>Run & Run!</i>

02:56.410 --> 03:03.700
<i>Aspirations are the one buzz, buzz, buzz that gets us moving</i>

02:56.410 --> 03:03.700
<i>akogare dake ga boku-ra o chiri-chiri-chiri ugokasu yo
</i>

03:03.700 --> 03:06.620
<i>Blaze, blaze, blaze! Let's go, it's kickoff!</i>

03:03.700 --> 03:06.620
<i>mera-mera-mera iku ze kickoff</i>

03:06.620 --> 03:11.550
<i>Leap out into a giant field of dreams</i>

03:06.620 --> 03:11.550
<i>tobidasô dodekai dream field</i>

03:22.680 --> 03:26.300
<i>The second half begins with Nankatsu's kick-off.</i>

03:23.720 --> 03:28.050
<b><b>EPISODE 24:
PERSEVERANCE, PURE PERSEVERANCE!</b></b>

03:28.350 --> 03:29.720
All right!

03:29.720 --> 03:34.060
Let's show them how Meiwa plays this game in the second half!

03:34.060 --> 03:35.560
Yeah!

03:35.560 --> 03:39.200
Go! Sink them in Meiwa's storm of tackles!

03:42.300 --> 03:47.780
<i>Meiwa's players fall on Tsubasa and Misaki right from the start!</i>

03:52.260 --> 03:55.790
<i>Tsubasa and Misaki barely manage to evade them!</i>

03:55.790 --> 03:57.380
All right! Go, Meiwa!

03:57.380 --> 03:59.040
That's the spirit!

04:02.600 --> 04:03.510
<i>Tsubasa...</i>

04:04.060 --> 04:06.380
I don't care if you let them slip to the sides.

04:06.380 --> 04:07.940
Just keep pushing for now!

04:07.940 --> 04:11.220
Faster! Just plunge into where the ball is!

04:14.810 --> 04:18.560
<i>Meiwa's players are pivoting with their hands to continue their tackles!</i>

04:18.560 --> 04:21.030
<i>Those are some seriously strong tackles!</i>

04:21.030 --> 04:23.860
<i>Tsubasa and Misaki can't even move an inch!</i>

04:27.330 --> 04:28.330
Something's off!

04:28.590 --> 04:31.620
Meiwa's playing way differently than they did the first half!

04:31.620 --> 04:32.710
Eat this!

04:33.900 --> 04:34.700
Tsubasa!

04:36.020 --> 04:38.080
<i>The ball reaches Tsubasa once more!</i>

04:40.880 --> 04:42.860
<i>But he's immediately trapped in a pincer attack!</i>

04:42.860 --> 04:44.220
<i>What will Tsubasa do?</i>

04:45.960 --> 04:49.730
<i>Tsubasa swiftly evades the tackle with a jump!</i>

04:49.730 --> 04:51.100
Nice jump!

04:51.100 --> 04:53.100
Watch out, Tsubasa!

04:53.840 --> 04:56.600
<i>Hyuga steals the ball in mid-air!</i>

04:56.600 --> 04:57.270
What?!

04:57.270 --> 04:58.150
Captain!

04:59.720 --> 05:01.680
We'll get it this time!

05:01.680 --> 05:03.610
All right! Follow our captain's lead!

05:03.610 --> 05:07.030
<i>You look like you're awfully into this in the second half, Meiwa.</i>

05:07.030 --> 05:09.860
<i>Hyuga rushes forward to Nankatsu's goal!</i>

05:09.860 --> 05:13.120
<i>This half's Meiwa is a completely different beast from last half's!</i>

05:13.120 --> 05:14.500
We'll stop them right here!

05:14.500 --> 05:15.200
All right!

05:15.200 --> 05:20.960
<i>Nankatsu's defense move to stop Hyuga's notorious straight-line dribbling!</i>

05:20.960 --> 05:22.550
<i>I'm counting on you, Takeshi!</i>

05:22.950 --> 05:23.760
What?!

05:23.760 --> 05:26.050
<i>That's a surprise!
Hyuga passes the ball back!</i>

05:26.050 --> 05:27.970
<i>The ball goes to Sawada.</i>

05:27.970 --> 05:29.060
<i>This feels wrong.</i>

05:29.060 --> 05:31.790
<i>Hyuga's completely different from what he was in the first half.</i>

05:31.790 --> 05:33.040
Let's go!

05:33.040 --> 05:37.180
<i>He charges straight into Nankatsu's penalty area!</i>

05:37.180 --> 05:38.440
Hyuga!

05:38.440 --> 05:40.870
It'll be dangerous if they pass the ball to Hyuga!

05:40.870 --> 05:42.940
Defenders! Mark Sawada!

05:42.940 --> 05:44.820
<i>Like I'd let you take this ball from me!</i>

05:44.820 --> 05:50.570
<i>I won't let Hyuga, who put his trust in me with this pass, nor my teammates' fighting spirit down...</i>

05:50.570 --> 05:54.790
<i>I'll use this ball to assist Hyuga with the last pass!</i>

05:57.830 --> 05:59.330
Here!

06:00.580 --> 06:02.580
<i>Takeshi Sawada sends a perfect cross,</i>

06:02.580 --> 06:07.470
<i>threading it through the minuscule gap between Nankatsu's defenders!</i>

06:07.470 --> 06:08.300
Takeshi!

06:08.300 --> 06:12.050
<i>Hyuga fires a direct shot from inside of the penalty area!</i>

06:18.580 --> 06:21.700
<i>However Wakabayashi uses his entire body to block it,</i>

06:21.700 --> 06:24.230
<i>just like he did against Hyuga's very first shot!</i>

06:24.230 --> 06:26.460
<i>This time it's different!</i>

06:26.460 --> 06:29.490
My shot was a second faster than you!

06:31.460 --> 06:34.490
<i>This time Wakabayashi's blown away!</i>

06:34.490 --> 06:35.280
Ah!

06:35.280 --> 06:36.200
Wakabayashi!

06:37.700 --> 06:39.960
<i>It looks like he'll be landing inside the goal!</i>

06:42.340 --> 06:43.210
We did it!

06:46.490 --> 06:48.750
<i>No, that's...</i>

06:48.750 --> 06:51.130
<i>Meiwa's stifled yet again!</i>

06:51.130 --> 06:53.130
<i>Even though his entire body's inside,</i>

06:53.130 --> 06:57.620
<i>Wakabayashi managed to keep the ball behind the goal line!</i>

06:57.620 --> 07:00.430
Nice, Wakabayashi!

07:00.430 --> 07:04.020
Hyuga wasn't even able to score inside the penalty area that time.

07:04.020 --> 07:08.020
<i>Wakabayashi's defense is as impregnable as it was in the first half!</i>

07:08.020 --> 07:12.320
<i>However Meiwa's enthusiasm too is on another level compared to the first half.</i>

07:13.230 --> 07:14.180
God damn it!

07:14.180 --> 07:16.370
Why do you have to catch it?

07:16.370 --> 07:18.770
My brother finally fired a shot!

07:18.770 --> 07:19.910
You bastard!

07:19.910 --> 07:23.380
<i>Mom, Takeru, Naoko, Masaru...</i>

07:23.380 --> 07:24.690
What's wrong, Kojiro?

07:24.690 --> 07:26.750
Hurry up and score!

07:26.750 --> 07:30.420
If you don't, our trip from Saitama will have been wasted!

07:30.420 --> 07:33.370
Whatever they say, victory depends on your legs!

07:33.370 --> 07:35.540
Do everything you can and turn this around!

07:35.540 --> 07:37.140
That's right!

07:37.140 --> 07:43.060
Ko-ji-ro! Ko-ji-ro!

07:38.780 --> 07:41.020
W-why are you all here?

07:41.020 --> 07:43.060
Kojiro...

07:43.060 --> 07:45.560
Guys, I trust you to score another!

07:45.950 --> 07:46.940
Here!

07:48.070 --> 07:49.440
<i>Wakabayashi!</i>

07:49.440 --> 07:52.950
<i>This time, I'll make sure to score one against you!</i>

07:52.950 --> 07:54.450
Here, Tsubasa!

07:54.450 --> 07:57.660
<i>Nankatsu passes the ball to Tsubasa without any delay.</i>

07:57.660 --> 07:58.720
All right! Go, Tsubasa!

07:58.720 --> 08:02.710
<i>Despite being a center forward,
Tsubasa is also a playmaker in the midfield.</i>

08:02.710 --> 08:06.210
<i>He might be small, but he's Nankatsu's ace, all right.</i>

08:06.920 --> 08:09.920
<i>Is your leg well, Genzo?</i>

08:09.920 --> 08:12.820
<i>You may be allowed to play in this single match,</i>

08:12.820 --> 08:18.100
<i>but you've had to stop all of Hyuga's powerful shots in the first half.</i>

08:18.100 --> 08:22.570
<i>Normally, that level of effort would add up
to more than that of a single match.</i>

08:22.570 --> 08:24.730
Takasugi! Go a little further!

08:28.090 --> 08:34.360
<i>Wakabayashi stopped Sawada's shot with his injured left leg at the end of the first half.</i>

08:34.360 --> 08:36.870
<i>We can't burden him anymore.</i>

08:36.870 --> 08:40.220
Misaki, let's score another one. For Wakabayashi's sake, this time!

08:40.220 --> 08:40.990
Okay!

08:40.990 --> 08:42.500
Who said you could?

08:42.500 --> 08:43.620
Here!

08:43.620 --> 08:44.320
What?!

08:44.320 --> 08:46.290
<i>Tsubasa sends a long pass to Izawa.</i>

08:46.940 --> 08:48.790
<i>They go right and left!</i>

08:48.790 --> 08:52.170
<i>With this development, Meiwa can't use those sliding tackles!</i>

08:52.670 --> 08:54.040
All right! That's it!

08:54.040 --> 08:58.430
It's better if we play without Misaki and Tsubasa sticking together!

08:58.430 --> 08:59.860
Please, guys!

08:59.860 --> 09:01.970
Make sure to defend our goal now!

09:01.970 --> 09:03.930
Then pass the ball to me!

09:03.930 --> 09:07.190
This time, for sure... I'll score for sure!

09:07.190 --> 09:08.310
Captain!

09:08.310 --> 09:09.310
<i>Hyuga...</i>

09:09.310 --> 09:11.270
<i>Kojiro...</i>

09:11.270 --> 09:12.910
All right! We'll defend here!

09:12.910 --> 09:14.520
Gather around the goal!

09:14.520 --> 09:16.700
We'll defend it at all costs!

09:16.700 --> 09:18.700
And we'll send our captain the ball!

09:18.700 --> 09:23.700
<i>Will Nankatsu be able to break through Meiwa, who have put everything they've got into defending?</i>

09:25.270 --> 09:29.460
<i>Meiwa steals the ball with a desperate sliding tackle!</i>

09:29.460 --> 09:32.430
<i>Oh, Misaki recovers the ball, giving them no chance to react!</i>

09:32.430 --> 09:35.260
<i>He's in solid form, as usual!</i>

09:35.260 --> 09:38.550
<i>It's safe to say he's Nankatsu's second ace!</i>

09:38.550 --> 09:40.150
Misaki, send it up!

09:40.150 --> 09:41.930
Send it right above the goal!

09:42.810 --> 09:47.350
<i>Tsubasa gives Misaki directions and keeps running up to the goal by himself.</i>

09:47.350 --> 09:48.490
<i>They're scheming...!</i>

09:48.490 --> 09:51.440
<i>I can't let Misaki send that cross.</i>

09:53.730 --> 09:56.110
<i>Misaki is sending the ball in front of the goal...</i>

09:56.110 --> 09:59.860
<i>But here is Meiwa's Sawada with a sliding tackle!</i>

10:01.990 --> 10:03.750
<i>They clash!</i>

10:03.750 --> 10:06.410
<i>But Misaki's cross is just a moment faster!</i>

10:07.730 --> 10:08.710
Misaki!

10:09.660 --> 10:10.750
Tsubasa!

10:12.210 --> 10:15.190
<i>The ball is sent high up in front of Meiwa's goal.</i>

10:15.190 --> 10:17.470
All right! Leave it to me!

10:18.720 --> 10:20.470
<i>What is he thinking?</i>

10:20.470 --> 10:23.600
<i>Tsubasa aims for the goalpost and runs straight into it.</i>

10:23.600 --> 10:25.930
Crap! Is it what he was after?

10:27.020 --> 10:30.340
<i>Wakashimazu runs to the other goalpost as well!</i>

10:30.340 --> 10:31.940
<i>Please, let me make it in time...</i>

10:31.940 --> 10:33.690
Oh! This is...

10:33.690 --> 10:35.940
the move we used in our match against Nankatsu!

10:37.860 --> 10:40.670
<i>This is the bold move where one jumps off the crossbar,</i>

10:40.670 --> 10:42.920
<i>shooting from the highest point in the sky!</i>

10:42.920 --> 10:46.540
<i>It's the specialty of Hanawa's Tachibana Twins, acrobatic football!</i>

10:46.540 --> 10:47.750
<i>However...!</i>

10:50.160 --> 10:53.710
<i>Wakashimazu uses his triangle kick to jump off the crossbar as well!</i>

10:54.710 --> 10:58.340
<i>It's a grand mid-air battle between Wakashimazu and Tsubasa!</i>

11:01.710 --> 11:04.620
<i>Wakashimazu stops him!</i>

11:11.680 --> 11:13.770
I kept our promise, captain!

11:13.770 --> 11:16.480
Now it's your turn to score a goal!

11:16.480 --> 11:18.310
Everyone, fall back!

11:20.100 --> 11:20.940
Tsubasa...!

11:21.520 --> 11:23.010
Misaki...!

11:23.010 --> 11:27.880
<i>Nankatsu's two aces, Tsubasa and Misaki, lay aground in Meiwa's side.</i>

11:27.880 --> 11:29.980
<i>Both of the aces are down!</i>

11:29.980 --> 11:32.080
<i>Nankatsu's in big trouble!</i>

11:32.900 --> 11:34.500
<i>The ball is sent to Hyuga.</i>

11:34.500 --> 11:36.290
Don't panic, guys!

11:36.290 --> 11:38.180
First off, mark Hyuga!

11:38.180 --> 11:40.300
No matter what, we must hold here!

11:40.300 --> 11:41.420
Yes!

11:41.420 --> 11:42.840
<i>Wakabayashi!</i>

11:42.840 --> 11:46.680
<i>I've never felt such an intense urge
to score like this in my entire life.</i>

11:46.680 --> 11:48.800
Guys! Let's go and support our captain!

11:48.800 --> 11:50.180
Yeah!

11:53.640 --> 11:54.690
<i>Misaki...</i>

11:58.660 --> 12:00.940
<i>I always thought I was alone.</i>

12:02.220 --> 12:04.780
<i>That everyone around me was my enemy.</i>

12:06.240 --> 12:08.740
Damn it! We'll make sure to stop them.

12:08.740 --> 12:14.170
<i>But... it seems I had friends around me all along.</i>

12:14.170 --> 12:15.920
What is he plotting?

12:15.920 --> 12:17.980
Damn! If it has come to this...!

12:18.530 --> 12:19.170
What?!

12:20.420 --> 12:21.540
Kojiro!

12:21.540 --> 12:24.530
<i>We thought that Hyuga would break through with a dribble,</i>

12:24.530 --> 12:27.050
<i>but he's passed the ball to the side!</i>

12:28.780 --> 12:30.510
All right! Let's do this!

12:31.510 --> 12:33.390
Don't let Nankatsu get the ball!

12:33.390 --> 12:35.550
We'll get the last pass to our captain!

12:35.550 --> 12:38.880
Well done. That's some good, fast offense!

12:38.880 --> 12:41.690
<i>Coach Kira, who has trained me so far...</i>

12:42.480 --> 12:45.450
<i>Everyone who came all the way here to support me...</i>

12:46.450 --> 12:48.910
No matter what, don't let them pass it to Hyuga!

12:48.910 --> 12:51.240
I'll stop them at all costs.

12:51.240 --> 12:53.040
Over here, Ishi!

12:53.040 --> 12:54.910
<i>A very nice move by Sawada!</i>

12:54.910 --> 12:58.040
<i>He went behind the defenders' back to receive Ishi's pass.</i>

12:58.040 --> 12:58.810
Crap!

12:58.810 --> 13:00.420
I leave it to you, Takeshi!

13:00.420 --> 13:02.000
<i>That right, Takeshi.</i>

13:02.000 --> 13:06.320
<i>If it weren't for you, I'd have half the goals I do now.</i>

13:06.320 --> 13:08.180
Here, Hyuga!

13:08.180 --> 13:14.270
<i>Your reliable crosses always find their way straight to me.</i>

13:14.920 --> 13:16.270
<i>It reaches him!</i>

13:16.960 --> 13:21.770
<i>In front of Nankatsu's goal, in the penalty area, Hyuga has the ball!</i>

13:23.780 --> 13:29.210
<i>And above all, for my Mom, Takeru, Naoko and Masaru,</i>

13:29.210 --> 13:33.560
<i>I'll make sure this shot goes in!</i>

13:33.560 --> 13:36.540
<i>Hyuga fires off his 6th shot!</i>

13:36.540 --> 13:38.160
Stop him, Genzo!

13:38.160 --> 13:39.290
Wakabayashi!

13:41.130 --> 13:45.760
<i>Wakabayashi barely stops this powerful shot!</i>

13:45.760 --> 13:47.880
Wakabayashi...!

13:48.460 --> 13:49.460
Clear it!

13:49.460 --> 13:50.890
Please clear it!

13:57.150 --> 13:58.980
<i>Goal!</i>

13:58.980 --> 14:02.650
<i>In a brilliant display of pure perseverance,
Hyuga pushes the ball in!</i>

14:03.250 --> 14:05.150
<i>I did it...</i>

14:19.520 --> 14:20.540
<i>It's a tie!</i>

14:20.540 --> 14:24.240
<i>Hyuga's tenacity and spirit with that header</i>

14:20.540 --> 14:22.620
You've got guts Kojiro!

14:24.240 --> 14:28.600
<i>have allowed Meiwa to tie the match!</i>

14:25.910 --> 14:27.700
Good job, big bro!

14:27.700 --> 14:29.430
Big Bro, nice shot!

14:29.430 --> 14:31.280
<i>What a tenacious spirit!</i>

14:31.280 --> 14:33.300
<i>Hyuga, the Ferocious Tiger, has scored</i>

14:33.300 --> 14:38.770
<i>against Wakabayashi, who's been so proud of his iron defense!</i>

14:38.770 --> 14:40.570
You did it, Hyuga!

14:40.570 --> 14:41.770
It's a tie!

14:41.770 --> 14:43.130
You did it!

14:44.160 --> 14:45.150
Damn it!

14:45.930 --> 14:47.080
You guys did well.

14:47.080 --> 14:49.400
As expected of you, Kojiro Hyuga.

14:49.400 --> 14:53.020
Just as the defenders were going to kick the ball,

14:53.020 --> 14:57.110
the audacity to push the ball through right into the goal.

14:57.110 --> 14:59.620
You really are a wild and ferocious tiger.

15:02.720 --> 15:05.490
Hyuga, your forehead is bleeding.

15:05.490 --> 15:06.960
Are you all right?

15:06.960 --> 15:09.290
It's just a scratch.

15:09.290 --> 15:11.910
More importantly, we are gonna have

15:11.910 --> 15:13.910
to turn the tables using this momentum.

15:13.910 --> 15:15.890
Yeah!

15:19.360 --> 15:20.680
<i>Misaki...</i>

15:21.820 --> 15:24.180
Damn it, they've tied the game.

15:24.180 --> 15:25.040
Tsubasa!

15:25.040 --> 15:26.480
You all right, Tsubasa?

15:26.480 --> 15:28.440
Yeah, I'm fine, I'm fine.

15:28.440 --> 15:33.200
<i>It looks like Tsubasa, with his limping, will continue the match.</i>

15:34.830 --> 15:36.900
Misaki, are you alright?

15:36.900 --> 15:38.660
<i>Misaki is unable to stand up.</i>

15:38.660 --> 15:42.040
<i>He's about to receive treatment outside the ground.</i>

15:44.700 --> 15:48.960
<i>Looks like the tides have turned in our favor.</i>

15:48.960 --> 15:51.280
<i>Until Misaki's treatment is complete,</i>

15:51.280 --> 15:52.420
<i>Nankatsu has no choice</i>

15:52.420 --> 15:54.220
<i>but to continue with a 10-man squad.</i>

15:54.220 --> 15:57.600
<i>The match restarts with Nankatsu's kick-off!</i>

15:57.600 --> 15:59.200
It's still a tie!

15:59.200 --> 16:01.620
Don't hold back and keep attacking!

16:01.620 --> 16:03.440
Yeah!

16:04.770 --> 16:06.940
Go fast! Cut the ball!

16:06.940 --> 16:09.860
Let's quickly take the lead with a goal!

16:09.860 --> 16:10.690
Yeah!

16:10.690 --> 16:12.690
Take this, Tsubasa!

16:12.690 --> 16:17.200
<i>Nankatsu wastes no time in passing the ball to their ace.</i>

16:17.200 --> 16:18.870
<i>Is his leg okay?</i>

16:20.690 --> 16:21.950
<i>He dodges one.</i>

16:21.950 --> 16:24.330
<i>It looks like he's fine.</i>

16:24.330 --> 16:25.290
<i>That's wrong.</i>

16:25.290 --> 16:28.130
<i>His movements aren't as sharp as they should be.</i>

16:28.130 --> 16:30.620
<i>He may have really injured his leg.</i>

16:30.620 --> 16:33.260
<i>The one waiting for Tsubasa, is Hyuga.</i>

16:33.800 --> 16:35.260
<i>I'll definitely take this ball!</i>

16:35.260 --> 16:37.300
<i>I won't lose this ball!</i>

16:37.940 --> 16:40.310
<i>It's a fierce clash between the two!</i>

16:56.480 --> 16:59.530
<i>Ah! Hyuga has taken the ball from Tsubasa!</i>

17:00.270 --> 17:03.040
<i>Tsubasa is blown away!</i>

17:04.540 --> 17:07.200
That Tsubasa who always drew those clashes

17:07.200 --> 17:08.650
has just been blown away!

17:08.650 --> 17:10.710
There's no doubt he injured his leg too!

17:10.710 --> 17:15.420
<i>Meiwa swiftly attacks and closes in on Nankatsu's goal.</i>

17:15.420 --> 17:18.060
<i>With Tsubasa and Misaki on the sidelines,</i>

17:18.060 --> 17:21.430
<i>if it's not me, who will do it?</i>

17:21.430 --> 17:23.100
Mark Hyuga!

17:23.100 --> 17:23.930
Yeah!

17:23.930 --> 17:25.430
Go, Sawaki!

17:25.430 --> 17:27.440
<i>Hyuga relies on his team again!</i>

17:27.440 --> 17:29.480
<i>Sawaki is unmarked!</i>

17:29.480 --> 17:31.230
Eat this!

17:31.230 --> 17:32.440
All {not}right!

17:34.120 --> 17:37.200
<i>Wakabayashi loses his balance!</i>

17:41.290 --> 17:44.920
<i>Wakabayashi barely escapes,
deflecting the ball out for a corner kick.</i>

17:44.920 --> 17:46.040
Wakabayashi!

17:47.530 --> 17:52.800
<i>Is Wakabayashi's injured leg flaring up again?</i>

17:52.800 --> 17:53.960
What!?

17:53.960 --> 17:55.710
Is Wakabayashi's leg injured, too?

17:55.710 --> 18:01.700
<i>The goalkeeper, Wakabayashi; the midfielder, Misaki; finally, the forward, Tsubasa.</i>

18:01.700 --> 18:04.390
<i>All three of them are injured.</i>

18:04.390 --> 18:10.190
<i>It seems as if the tides have started turning towards Meiwa's victory.</i>

18:10.190 --> 18:12.350
Will you be able to continue?

18:12.350 --> 18:14.840
Yes, it's all right.

18:14.840 --> 18:16.390
No problem on my side.

18:16.390 --> 18:19.950
Hey guys, we really need to step it up now!

18:19.950 --> 18:21.060
Ishizaki...

18:21.060 --> 18:24.400
This entire time, we've been relying on
Tsubasa, Misaki and Wakabayashi.

18:24.400 --> 18:26.700
We really need to pull our weight as hard as we can, now!

18:26.700 --> 18:29.460
We have no choice but to get through this one ourselves!

18:29.460 --> 18:29.960
Yeah!

18:29.960 --> 18:31.500
Ishizaki ain't lying!

18:31.500 --> 18:32.980
We gotta work our hardest!

18:32.980 --> 18:35.250
It's our time to shine!

18:35.250 --> 18:36.880
Okay, guys! We are going to do it!

18:36.880 --> 18:38.480
Nankatsu, fight!

18:38.480 --> 18:39.230
Guys...

18:39.230 --> 18:40.590
Yeah!

18:41.180 --> 18:44.100
<i>We're 12 minutes into the second half.</i>

18:44.100 --> 18:46.220
<i>Meiwa will be taking a corner kick.</i>

18:46.220 --> 18:49.350
<i>This is a great chance to take the lead.</i>

18:49.350 --> 18:52.230
Good, take the lead with this corner kick!

18:54.150 --> 18:55.270
All right!

18:55.270 --> 18:57.530
<i>Hyuga moves towards the goal!</i>

18:58.940 --> 19:00.910
<i>He can't jump!</i>

19:00.910 --> 19:01.950
Genzo!

19:01.950 --> 19:03.610
Got it!

19:03.610 --> 19:05.100
<i>Hyuga is jumping!</i>

19:05.100 --> 19:07.560
<i>Will he be able to take the lead with this header?!</i>

19:09.750 --> 19:11.750
Where do you think you're going?!

19:12.450 --> 19:17.050
<i>Izawa and Takasugi desperately block
Hyuga's header with their own heads!</i>

19:17.050 --> 19:18.340
What?!

19:23.380 --> 19:26.350
<i>The loose ball is cleared!</i>

19:26.350 --> 19:29.100
<i>Nankatsu escapes the danger!</i>

19:29.100 --> 19:29.940
Yes!

19:29.940 --> 19:32.020
Good job guys!

19:32.020 --> 19:33.580
Guys...

19:33.580 --> 19:35.590
Coach, please hurry with your treatment.

19:35.590 --> 19:36.690
Sure.

19:36.690 --> 19:39.380
<i>The wound is deeper than I thought.</i>

19:39.380 --> 19:41.740
<i>I can't have him play in this condition...</i>

19:41.740 --> 19:44.850
<i>With Misaki off the field, Nankatsu is focusing on defense.</i>

19:44.850 --> 19:46.990
<i>Despite that, their defense is dogged!</i>

19:46.990 --> 19:48.560
You bastard!

19:48.560 --> 19:51.540
<i>Every pass towards their ace, Hyuga, is being cut!</i>

19:51.540 --> 19:56.420
<i>Despite being pressured so hard,
they've yet to give up a good chance.</i>

19:56.420 --> 19:58.900
We will do this!

19:58.900 --> 20:03.140
For every time we depended on Tsubasa, Misaki and Wakabayashi...

20:03.140 --> 20:04.980
This time...

20:04.980 --> 20:08.260
This time, we will be the ones to do it!

20:08.260 --> 20:11.270
<i>Guys!</i>

20:11.270 --> 20:16.240
<i>Among all of Nankatsu's players, Tsubasa is the only one not participating in defense</i>

20:16.240 --> 20:18.140
<i>despite the tough situation!</i>

20:18.140 --> 20:21.690
<i>Does his leg hurt that bad?</i>

20:21.690 --> 20:23.280
<i>Tsubasa...</i>

20:25.780 --> 20:29.780
Is Tsubasa's leg hurt that badly...?

20:29.780 --> 20:34.090
No, Tsubasa is not the kind of player
to fold in a situation such as this.

20:34.090 --> 20:36.790
I'm sure he's planning something.

20:37.450 --> 20:39.790
<i>Aren't you, Tsubasa?</i>

20:41.670 --> 20:45.960
<i>The ball finally reaches Hyuga in front of the goal!</i>

20:45.960 --> 20:46.930
Crap!

20:48.800 --> 20:51.060
Even if my leg were to break... I'll catch this shot!

20:51.060 --> 20:53.060
<i>Eat this, Wakabayashi!</i>

20:57.610 --> 21:04.450
<i>Woah! He blocked Hyuga's Bullet Shot with his face!</i>

20:58.190 --> 21:00.860
Ishizaki!

21:09.340 --> 21:10.870
As if I'd lose!

21:10.870 --> 21:13.100
This guy...

21:13.100 --> 21:15.640
<i>Nankatsu gets out of another dangerous situation,</i>

21:15.640 --> 21:19.000
<i>thanks to the efforts of the ambushing soldier, Ishizaki!</i>

21:19.000 --> 21:22.760
<i>They are protecting the goal as a unit indeed!</i>

21:19.000 --> 21:20.780
You were awesome, Ishizaki!

21:20.780 --> 21:22.760
Nice ball clear!

21:22.760 --> 21:24.470
Good going, Ishizaki!

21:24.470 --> 21:25.760
You put up a good fight!

21:29.100 --> 21:35.080
<i>Nankatsu's #11, Misaki's treatment has completed,
and he now returns to the field.</i>

21:37.570 --> 21:38.900
<i>Taro.</i>

21:38.900 --> 21:40.140
Misaki.

21:40.140 --> 21:41.360
Tsubasa.

21:41.360 --> 21:43.360
I know what you are thinking.

21:43.360 --> 21:44.150
Huh?

21:44.150 --> 21:47.030
I will steal the ball and pass it to you for sure.

21:47.030 --> 21:48.370
Misaki...

21:50.030 --> 21:55.290
<i>Yeah, as my leg is injured right now,
I can't transition between offense and defense.</i>

21:55.290 --> 21:59.040
<i>But I trust them in their efforts.</i>

21:59.040 --> 22:04.360
<i>Meiwa is so busy with offense, that they've forgotten about defense now.</i>

22:04.360 --> 22:08.260
<i>So, if you guys can steal the ball, and send it to me here...</i>

22:08.300 --> 22:11.430
<i>My sole opponent will be only Wakashimazu himself.</i>

22:11.430 --> 22:14.630
<i>I can definitely score, even with this leg.</i>

22:14.630 --> 22:18.780
<i>In just one counter attack...
we can take the lead again!</i>

22:38.790 --> 22:44.670
<i>chotto are mi na ace ga tooru</i>

22:38.790 --> 22:44.670
<i>Hey, look over there at the ace passing through</i>

22:44.670 --> 22:50.680
<i>suguremono zo to machijû sawagu</i>

22:44.670 --> 22:50.680
<i>He's the best, and the whole town cheers him on</i>

22:50.680 --> 22:56.680
<i>chô-chô samba, zigzag samba</i>

22:50.680 --> 22:56.680
<i>Butterfly samba, zig-zag samba</i>

22:56.680 --> 23:02.150
<i>aitsu no uwasa de chamba mo hashiru</i>

22:56.680 --> 23:02.150
<i>Even little old ladies go around talking about him</i>

23:03.110 --> 23:08.280
<i>sore ni tsukete mo ore-tacha nan na no</i>

23:03.110 --> 23:08.280
<i>So, even if we have him, who are we?</i>

23:09.200 --> 23:14.990
<i>ball hitotsu ni kiri-kiri mai sa</i>

23:09.200 --> 23:14.990
<i>The ball spins round and round</i>

23:14.990 --> 23:21.040
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:21.040 --> 23:26.050
<i>itsuka kimeru ze inazuma shoot</i>

23:21.040 --> 23:26.050
<i>One day, I'll score with a lightning shot!</i>

23:27.340 --> 23:33.220
<i>son toki ore ga super hero sa</i>

23:27.340 --> 23:33.220
<i>When that happens, I'll become a super hero!</i>

23:33.220 --> 23:39.100
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:39.100 --> 23:45.980
<i>moete seishun kakenukero</i>

23:39.100 --> 23:45.980
<i>This fierce youth is on the field!</i>

23:50.070 --> 24:00.680
COMING UP, EPISODE 25:
COUNTERATTACK ON FIRE
